 topology    | gettopogeomelements                          | CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION topology.gettopogeomelements(toponame character varying, layerid integer, tgid integer)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
